### Base (host `make run` defaults to :18080 — devcontainer Mac host often :8081)
@base = http://localhost:18080

### Health (204 No Content)
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Swagger UI (200 HTML — open `{{base}}/docs` in a browser for Try it out)
GET {{base}}/docs

### List GPUs (200 JSON)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/gpus

### Telemetry for GPU — all rows (no time filter). Load data: psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f examples/seed.sql
GET {{base}}/api/v1/gpus/gpu-001/telemetry

### Telemetry with time window (filters processed_at_unix_nano; must align with seed.sql)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/gpus/gpu-001/telemetry?start_time=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&end_time=2026-05-04T00:00:00Z

### Invalid: bad start_time (400 JSON error)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/gpus/gpu-001/telemetry?start_time=not-a-date

### Invalid: start after end (400) — service rejects window
GET {{base}}/api/v1/gpus/gpu-001/telemetry?start_time=2026-05-10T00:00:00Z&end_time=2026-05-01T14:15:00Z
